================================================================================
THIRD-PARTY COMPONENTS AND ATTRIBUTION
================================================================================

This setup configuration integrates the following open-source projects:

1. ARCHON AI PLATFORM
   Repository: https://github.com/coleam00/Archon
   Author: Cole Medin (@coleam00)
   License: See Archon repository for current license terms
   Description: Advanced AI application with MCP integration and knowledge management

2. SUPABASE BACKEND-AS-A-SERVICE
   Repository: https://github.com/supabase/supabase
   Organization: Supabase
   License: Apache License 2.0
   Description: Open-source Firebase alternative with PostgreSQL and real-time capabilities

3. SUPABASE DOCKER CONFIGURATION
   Source: https://github.com/supabase/supabase/tree/master/docker
   License: Apache License 2.0
   Usage: Base configuration files adapted for this local development setup

